+**E3 — Contrast: PR path alive.** Run 4618 pushed 9e6bbc9 to main at 05:15:26Z (PR #1979, watchdog satellite refinement). PR #1982 landed its closeout — `docs/reports/CI_1897_1933_STALE_CLOSEOUT_2026-10-28.md` is present on main (blob 3bb255f, 7637 bytes; directory listing probe). #1897 and #1933 are both closed (verified via `bridge.read_feedback`), closed by the PR's closing keywords rather than by any intake verdict.
+
+**E4 — Historical cadence.** Runs 8 through 12 landed bridge work orders the same night they were filed (#1775, #1848, #1892, #1914 classes). A 3.5-hour zero-verdict window over 20 items exceeds every cadence observed on this tower.
