+**E5 — Adjacent anomaly.** The only infrastructure anomaly logged inside the window is the **eviction** (per #1963: main force-pushed back to d75596d; d9d9385 and 7f8d8df became unfetchable). Its triage and the #1980 re-land order both sit inside the stalled queue — the stall also swallows the incident's own remediation traffic.
